  triage:closureNote "Independently re-verified against real code on feature/pAI-s28-bounded-peer-recovery current head c0445b1a (not accepted from arch-ctm's b7d84882 self-report). drain() now spans lines 250-321 (72 lines), below the 80-line RULE-002 threshold, verified by brace-depth counting. gh pr checks 634: 8/8 green including Just-lint on all three OS legs at c0445b1a." ;
